AddonId: SplashAddonS
Type: Generic
Name: Splash Addon
Author: Artzox
ShortDescription: Show a splash screen of your background image and logo for a predefined time based on game launch.
InstallerManifestUrl: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/artzox/Playnite-Splash-Addon/master/Manifest/SplashAddon.yaml
SourceUrl: https://github.com/artzox/Playnite-Splash-Addon
Description: Shows a splash screen on game launch for a user-defined amount of time.
  The splash screen in a combination of your game background image and a logo (when using Extra MetaData Loader). Allows to configure game or platform-specific timers, as well as deciding what will be the trigger - game launch or being in game. No other splash screens are supported (outside images or videos) or planned.
Tags: ["Launch", "Splashscreen", "Loader", "Image", "Logo", "Transition"]
